&ACCESS  RV
&COMMENT 03-10-R1 PNW1 NEXT NUT REQUEST
DEF  Request_next_nut ( )
;********************************
; Gestamp Standards
; Line - BMW G65 (cell 03)
; Robot 03-10-R1 (BMW-03-10-R1-PNW1)
; Application - REQUEST THE NEXT NUT PRELOAD AT CENTERLINE PEDESTAL
;********************************
; CALLED BY TRIGGER (PRIO = -1) ON THE LAST MOTION OF style1app1opt1A/B (DISTANCE = 0) AND
; style1app1opt2A/B (DISTANCE = 1), AFTER THE PEDESTAL (ALSO IN DRY CYCLE). SETS NUT_START: THE
; SUBMIT PROGRAM PRELOAD() (CALLED BY sps.sub) THEN FEEDS AND LOADS THE NEXT NUT AND SETS
; NUT_READY AND NEXT_NUT_READY - ITS STEPS RUN ONLY OUTSIDE DRY CYCLE (F04).
;NOTE: A TRIGGER SKIPPED BY A PROGRAM RESET OR A BLOCK SELECTION MEANS NO PRELOAD REQUEST (F14)
;NOTE: NUTS 2 AND 3 (style1app1opt2A/B, 3A/B) WAIT FOR NEXT_NUT_READY BEFORE THEY MOVE IN; IN DRY
;  CYCLE NOTHING SETS IT AND THE CYCLE HANGS THERE (F04)
;********************************

;CLEAR NEXT_NUT_READY, SET NEXT_NUT_REQUEST, START PRELOAD (NUT_START=TRUE)
   NEXT_NUT_READY=FALSE
   NEXT_NUT_REQUEST=TRUE
   NUT_START=TRUE

END